      "mergeID": "656627572de618edf9c936b4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When looking at avatar menu, closing the menu leaves behind a floating avatar. the Avatar moves to the right side of your menu when you open the menu up again. I did not have a mirror up and I was in a world I uploaded so I know there isn't the mini preview prefab in there.\n\nSpecifically it seemed to happen when you look at a model you uploaded, then looked in the fallback menu, then closed the menu entirely. It goes away if you open avatar details then close the menu.\n\nIt might only happen on my avatars with base and action layers in the Avatar Descriptor. Need to check more.\n\nI was on desktop when this happened.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Closing Menu Leaves a Floating Avatar Preview",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "655ed76ae0dd5d0589aed4ab",
